    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0015-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:46:27.782+09:00">所以说.知人善任，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:46:31.695+09:00">是君王之道；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:46:38.154+09:00">了解事理的变通，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:46:42.166+09:00">是为臣之道。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:47:12.154+09:00">无形的东西，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:47:28.432+09:00">看不见源头的东西，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:47:21.468+09:00">才是万物的主宰；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:47:34.575+09:00">才是世事人情的根本。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:47:38.732+09:00">鼓声不干预五音，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:47:42.282+09:00">却能作五音的统帅。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:48:23.224+09:00">掌握了君道真谛的人，不用去做文武百官各自负责的具体事务，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.79" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:48:31.416+09:00">就可以成为国家的最高统治者。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:48:35.754+09:00">君主恪守其君道，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:48:44.211+09:00">官员了解其所负责的具体事务，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.82" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:49:19.492+09:00">自古以来便是如此。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.83" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:49:30.811+09:00">正因为先圣贤王通晓这一道理，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.84" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:49:56.763+09:00">所以他才会把不是他自己的东西当作自己的一样支配使用，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.85" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T04:59:15.415+09:00">善于这样做的，才算是真正懂得了为君之道。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.108" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T05:02:40.946+09:00">这就是善于把别人的长处为己利用的意思。］</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.109" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T05:03:18.822+09:00">上面所说的是通晓治国之略的统治者的做法，而那些不明白为君之道的统治者则不是这样。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.110" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T05:04:22.007+09:00">他们往往凡事都要亲自去做，自然就不会任用贤士。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.111" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T05:04:45.458+09:00">不能信任、重用有才能的贤士，则有才能的贤士就会忌恨他。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.112" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T05:04:54.576+09:00">其最终结果，只能是功业受到损害，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.113" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T05:05:43.218+09:00">国家出现危机。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.134" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T05:08:44.561+09:00">在用人上是这样，在对待财富上亦是如此。从前，商汤、周武王消灭了夏桀、纣王，一日之间便拥有了夏、商的全部财富•</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.135" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T05:08:57.155+09:00">他们把土地和财宝封赏给有功之臣，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.136" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T05:09:10.583+09:00">举国上下没有不心悦诚服的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.137" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T05:09:38.729+09:00">将亡国者的财富赏赐给功臣，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.138" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T05:09:47.232+09:00">那么天下之人都会争相效命，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0015_CH7x2006_002-1a.139" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-11-06T05:09:53.154+09:00">这就是懂得如何使用不属于自己的东西的惯常作法。</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
